# P12 round 4: the Morph target on the Tracker Mini, Mini keys only. Instr held + Up x3 picks Synth 1, Menu box 1 (Instrument Parameters)
# opens the Synth screen, Shift held + Right x2 moves the part's Morph target from the default slot 1 to slot 3 (popup "Morph target: 3",
# the patch panel heading "Slot 0  Morph 3:"). plus_flows.sh reads the target afterwards (UISHOT_TRACE_MORPH): 1, 2, 3 and nothing else.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh mini
title: Morph target on the Mini (P12)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Instr
wait 400ms
tap Up x3
wait 300ms
release Instr
wait 600ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Right
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1200ms
expect text "Slot 0:"
press Shift
wait 300ms
tap Right
wait 400ms
tap Right
wait 400ms
release Shift
wait 600ms
expect text "Morph target: 3"
expect text "Slot 0  Morph 3:"
shot morph-target
